[11.56, "o", "warn runs_disk ~/scratch/runs (not created yet, measured at ~/scratch) is on a \r\n"]
[11.6, "o", "nearly full file system (0.0 GiB free, 90% used): point SPECTIO_RUNS_ROOT (runs_root in spectio.toml, spectio init --runs-root) \r\n"]
[11.64, "o", "at a larger scratch or group file system\r\n"]
[11.68, "o", "warn uv 0.9.29 ~/bin/uv is older than 0.13.7: its Pythons may carry an SQLite that Spectio refuses; \r\n"]
[11.72, "o", "upgrade it (uv self update, or its installer)\r\n"]
