[25.66, "o", "Spectio 0.0.1 is running on demo-hpc-login1, on the Unix socket $TMPDIR/spectio-0/spectio.sock.\r\n"]
[25.7, "o", "1. On your laptop, open a tunnel:  ssh -N -L 127.0.0.1:18080:$TMPDIR/spectio-0/spectio.sock alice@demo-hpc-login1\r\n"]
[25.74, "o", "2. Then open this link (single use, valid 15 minutes):\r\n"]
[25.78, "o", "   http://127.0.0.1:18080/auth/link#<ticket>\r\n"]
[25.82, "o", "New link at any time: spectio login --print-link\r\n"]
[25.86, "o", "Spectio never asks you to paste a link.\r\n"]
